OL,3,AUK meat industry hit by cyber-attack
OL,4,Awhich targeted European supermarket
OL,5,Afreezers
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe British Association of Independent
OL,8,FMeat Suppliers (AIMS) told the BBC some
OL,9,Fof its more than 300 members had
OL,10,Funexpectedly become what it called
OL,11,F"collateral" as part of the hacks.
OL,23,APub: 03-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG8/18
