CT,25,T
PS,c000
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F119A1793787510
OL,1,W5j 5Q7+j 55"k#j 5w;js1
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-.*,%-,* *,%%**,$ ,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,AWhy Kim Kardashian came back to 'the
OL,4,Aworst TV drama ever'
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt was meant to be Kim Kardashian's
OL,7,Ftriumphant debut as a leading actor -
OL,8,Fbut last year's legal drama All's Fair
OL,9,Fwas so universally panned by critics
OL,10,Fthat it actually broke streaming
OL,11,Frecords as audiences clambered to see
OL,12,Fwhat all the fuss was about.
OL,14,FKardashian, who is best known as a
OL,15,Fmedia personality and businesswoman,
OL,16,Ftells the BBC she had no choice but to
OL,17,F"lean into" the discourse and come back
OL,18,Ffor a second series.
OL,20,F"We thought we were this law show,
OL,21,Fdealing with some really serious
OL,22,Fissues," she jokes.
OL,23,APub: 04-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG11/18
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
FL,163,160,200,105,0,100
PN,11912
SC,0012
CT,25,T
PS,c000
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F119A1793787510
OL,1,W5j 5Q7+j 55"k#j 5w;js1
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-.*,%-,* *,%%**,$ ,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,AWhy Kim Kardashian came back to 'the
OL,4,Aworst TV drama ever'
OL,5,
OL,6,FBut viewers mostly enjoyed its comedy
OL,7,Fvalue - with outlandish outfits and
OL,8,Fzingy one-liners from co-stars Sarah
OL,9,FPaulson and Glenn Close sending the
OL,10,Fshow straight into the pantheon of
OL,11,F'camp classics'.
OL,23,APub: 04-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG12/18
